      {"value": "Automates building, testing, and deploying code, connecting to GitHub, Bitbucket, or GitLab. Offered as cloud or self-hosted (CircleCI Server). Newer AI agent Chunk monitors pipelines and fixes flaky tests and broken builds; also Orbs and an Insights dashboard.", "page_id": 337, "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CircleCI", "confidence": "medium"}
